      { "date": "2026-11-23", "question": "Will any party other than a security vendor publish a count of fully automated intrusions, with a stated method?", "would_settle": "A CISA, ENISA, NCSC or CERT-EU advisory giving a number of agent-run intrusions with a stated collection method, or a second vendor publishing overlapping indicators for the exploit_agent framework." }
